# Bring Up With Love (Q020): a level 65 character reads Tunatun's whole explanation (both answers
# of the question page) and accepts; until the jewel of innocence is found Tunatun only reminds
# the player. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q020_bring_up_with_love.golden
character Tamer 65
script quest.Q020_BringUpWithLove
item 7185 57
page default/31537.htm
page script/quest/Q020_BringUpWithLove/
npc tunatun 31537 Folk 10 0 0

# Tunatun explains, then the player accepts.
action tunatun
